{
 "type": "text",
 "heading": "Neighbors",
 "text": "Units are neighbors by the categories of 'group' (Groups): in a compartment of category g, neighbors_<bin> is the sum over g' of w[g][g'] times the amount of the bin in g', and neighbors the same sum over every bin. The weights w[g][g'] are the identity."
}
